<h2 style="color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Password Reset</h2>
<p style="color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{firstName}}, we received a request to reset your password.</p>
<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}"
     style="display: inline-block; background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">
    Reset Password
  </a>
</p>
<p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 16px 0 0 0;">
  If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br/>
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color: #6366f1; word-break: break-all;">{{resetUrl}}</a>
</p>
<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; margin: 24px 0 0 0;">This link expires in 1 hour. If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
